(7730834, 1273246, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fabulous view. I love all the green ''sprinkles''. The tiny boat is a great point of interest and shows me the scale of all this. 10. Top pick.</td>', 'Fabulous view. I love all the green ''sprinkles''. The tiny boat is a great point of interest and shows me the scale of all this. 10. Top pick.', '2022-10-07 23:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730835, 1273433, 173844, '<td valign="top">Love the Emerald City effect.  And the glowing softness that unifies the city, a tumult of architecture.  Beautifully framed by the dark foliage in the foreground and, in the background, the embrace of a languid sky.  With all those lit windows the scene looks like a phantasmagoric punch card.  Fine processing.  Luminous.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Love the Emerald City effect.  And the glowing softness that unifies the city, a tumult of architecture.  Beautifully framed by the dark foliage in the foreground and, in the background, the embrace of a languid sky.  With all those lit windows the scene looks like a phantasmagoric punch card.  Fine processing.  Luminous.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-10-07 23:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730836, 1273435, 173844, '<td valign="top">Liking the way the clouds snake through the foreground, which breaks up the mountains.  And now they must be put back together again by the gods.  Throws one off balance.  Also, it''s neat how the image is mostly in black and white, but fringed a bit by a subtle green.  Nice.</td>', 'Liking the way the clouds snake through the foreground, which breaks up the mountains.  And now they must be put back together again by the gods.  Throws one off balance.  Also, it''s neat how the image is mostly in black and white, but fringed a bit by a subtle green.  Nice.', '2022-10-08 00:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730837, 1273445, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how a title can lead you by the hand into the picture, and now you''re convinced that it''s just as advertised.  Whether it''s building or booming, I can hear it.  The stark contrast of the black and white treatment is dynamic.</td>', 'It''s funny how a title can lead you by the hand into the picture, and now you''re convinced that it''s just as advertised.  Whether it''s building or booming, I can hear it.  The stark contrast of the black and white treatment is dynamic.', '2022-10-08 00:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730838, 1273411, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice how the silhouetted elements front the beautiful sky.  The strong lines of the bridge are softly echoed by the few slender verticals.  What a moment in the day.  Now, those fish floating across the sky from right to left.  What??  Got to assume that they''re real, since this is a standard challenge. So, huh?<br/>Handsome.</td>', 'Nice how the silhouetted elements front the beautiful sky.  The strong lines of the bridge are softly echoed by the few slender verticals.  What a moment in the day.  Now, those fish floating across the sky from right to left.  What??  Got to assume that they''re real, since this is a standard challenge. So, huh?Handsome.', '2022-10-08 00:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730840, 1273246, 173844, '<td valign="top">The shimmer factor here is very high.  Also like the various shades of green that create the composition, which is very interesting - in the good way.  Ah, summer.</td>', 'The shimmer factor here is very high.  Also like the various shades of green that create the composition, which is very interesting - in the good way.  Ah, summer.', '2022-10-08 00:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730842, 1273443, 173844, '<td valign="top">The title says it all.  The furtive concentration in the act is perfectly shown.  The trees themselves are a major part of the image, the stage seemingly lit from within.  It''s a pleasure to be gifted with seeing this intimate moment.</td>', 'The title says it all.  The furtive concentration in the act is perfectly shown.  The trees themselves are a major part of the image, the stage seemingly lit from within.  It''s a pleasure to be gifted with seeing this intimate moment.', '2022-10-08 00:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730843, 1273310, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a terrific composition comprised of colors, shapes and textures.  That''s without even focusing on what you''re seeing.  Hearty fare.</td>', 'What a terrific composition comprised of colors, shapes and textures.  That''s without even focusing on what you''re seeing.  Hearty fare.', '2022-10-08 00:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
