(7730848, 1273439, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just browsing the FS results and noticed you are back! Good to see you here again. Maybe you''ve been back for a while and just quiet in the forums...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-10-08 00:30:32.</i></td>', 'Just browsing the FS results and noticed you are back! Good to see you here again. Maybe you''ve been back for a while and just quiet in the forums...', '2022-10-08 01:30:12.000000', '2022-10-08 01:30:32.000000', 0),
(7730852, 1273430, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> Baby?  Sexist and/or racist. Please explain. Very rare that a title kills such a terrific capture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Titled inspired by the line "Nobody puts Baby in a corner" from the movie "Dirty Dancing", chosen because I thought "In the Corner" was a boring title. Baby was the female lead''s name.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-10-08 03:53:02.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: Baby?  Sexist and/or racist. Please explain. Very rare that a title kills such a terrific capture.   Titled inspired by the line "Nobody puts Baby in a corner" from the movie "Dirty Dancing", chosen because I thought "In the Corner" was a boring title. Baby was the female lead''s name.', '2022-10-08 04:49:08.000000', '2022-10-08 04:53:02.000000', 0),
(7730854, 1273430, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kasaba:</b></div><hr/><i> You are giving away your age ;-) Love the stark contrast, pity about the shoe being cut off, and I am still considering your crop ... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The cut off shoe was unfortunate. This was a candid shot and I didn''t notice it until I downloaded the photo onto my computer. I only cropped off the right where there was another person.</td>', 'Originally posted by kasaba: You are giving away your age ;-) Love the stark contrast, pity about the shoe being cut off, and I am still considering your crop ...   The cut off shoe was unfortunate. This was a candid shot and I didn''t notice it until I downloaded the photo onto my computer. I only cropped off the right where there was another person.', '2022-10-08 04:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
